==PETITION.IO TAX RECEIPT TEMPLATE==

This template generates a legally binding tax receipt for cryptocurrency staking rewards with digital signatures.

==TEMPLATE VARIABLES==
ReceiptId: Text
Timestamp: DateTime
DonorENS: Text
WalletAddress: Text
TxHash: Text
PrincipalETH: Number
RewardsETH: Number
HighestPriceUSD: Number
CreditedValueUSD: Number
Allocations: Collection(
  Structure(
    Bucket: Text;
    Percent: Number
  )
)
Disclaimers: LargeText
IssuerIdentity: Identity
DonorIdentity: Identity
ContactEmail: Text
%>

# Petition.io — Tax Receipt

**Receipt ID:** [[ReceiptId Text]]  
**Date Issued:** [[Timestamp DateTime]]

---

## Donor Information
- ENS (optional): [[DonorENS Text]]  
- Wallet Address: [[WalletAddress Text]]

---

## Transaction Details
- Transaction Hash: [[TxHash Text]]  
- Explorer Link: https://etherscan.io/tx/[[TxHash]]

### QR Code
![Transaction QR](https://quickchart.io/qr?text=https://etherscan.io/tx/[[TxHash]])

---

## Staking Summary
- Principal Staked (ETH): [[PrincipalETH Number]]  
- Rewards Earned (ETH): [[RewardsETH Number]]  
- Highest ETH Price (USD): [[HighestPriceUSD Number]]

[[CreditedValueUSD Number]]: CreditedValueUSD = [[RewardsETH]] * [[HighestPriceUSD]]

- Credited Value (USD): [[CreditedValueUSD]]

---

## Allocation Breakdown
[[Allocations: Collection(
  Structure(
    Bucket Text,
    Percent Number
  )
)]]

[[#Each(Allocations)]]
- [[Bucket]] — [[Percent]]%
[[/Each]]

